cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data, please cite the archive and the specific data release."
title: "konis: an independent archive of public data on the 2026 Iowa Army Ammunition Plant lead azide detonation"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Hefrock and the konis contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Hefrock/konis"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - lead
  - air quality
  - environmental monitoring
  - open data
  - Iowa Army Ammunition Plant
abstract: >-
  Provenance-first archive of official pages, documents and environmental data published about
  the 25 November 2026 controlled detonation of degraded lead azide at the Iowa Army Ammunition
  Plant, Middletown, Iowa. Code is MIT-licensed; archived third-party content keeps its
  publishers' terms (see LICENSE-DATA.md).
